{"id":"e14c6e5a4be6a5db","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/721_ALCQ.md","title":"721 ALCQ","display":"721_ALCQ","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"721-ALCQ\">721 ALCQ</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\">\\(\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span> 是概念名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_R\">\\(N_R\\)</span> 是角色名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>ALCQ 的概念构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists},\n\\operatorname{qatleast},\\operatorname{qatmost}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists},\n\\operatorname{qatleast},\\operatorname{qatmost}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>限定数目限制显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\geq nR.C=\\operatorname{qatleast}(n,R,C),\n\\qquad\n\\leq nR.C=\\operatorname{qatmost}(n,R,C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\geq nR.C=\\operatorname{qatleast}(n,R,C),\n\\qquad\n\\leq nR.C=\\operatorname{qatmost}(n,R,C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-概念表达式\">2. 概念表达式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span> 为满足下列条款的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(C\\sqcap D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcup D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(C\\sqcup D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\exists R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\geq nR.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\geq nR.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq nR.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\leq nR.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-包含式与-TBox\">3. 包含式与 TBox</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>TBox 是有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-自由名字与替换\">4. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\{A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\{A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\geq nR.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\leq nR.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\geq nR.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\leq nR.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无绑定名字函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(X)=\\varnothing\n\\quad\n(X\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\cup\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}(X)=\\varnothing\n\\quad\n(X\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\cup\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\\)</span> 固定无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\">\\(e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span> 有限，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>捕获避免重命名就是保持排序的有限支撑替换。</p>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\">\\(\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\\)</span>，定义替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\theta_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\theta_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\geq nR.C)=\\geq n\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\geq nR.C)=\\geq n\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\leq nR.C)=\\leq n\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\leq nR.C)=\\leq n\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\equiv_\\alpha Y\\Longleftrightarrow X=Y\">\\(X\\equiv_\\alpha Y\\Longleftrightarrow X=Y\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 同属 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\geq}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\leq}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{clash}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\geq}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\leq}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{clash}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\\)</span> 为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{C\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqsubseteq\\top,\\ \\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{C\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqsubseteq\\top,\\ \\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D,\\ D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D,\\ D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot,\\ \\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot,\\ \\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>限定数目算术公理族定义如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\geq}\n=\n\\{\\geq mR.C\\sqsubseteq\\geq nR.C:\nR\\in N_R,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n\\leq m\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\geq}\n=\n\\{\\geq mR.C\\sqsubseteq\\geq nR.C:\nR\\in N_R,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n\\leq m\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\leq}\n=\n\\{\\leq nR.C\\sqsubseteq\\leq mR.C:\nR\\in N_R,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n\\leq m\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\leq}\n=\n\\{\\leq nR.C\\sqsubseteq\\leq mR.C:\nR\\in N_R,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n\\leq m\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{clash}}\n=\n\\{(\\geq mR.C)\\sqcap(\\leq nR.C)\\sqsubseteq\\bot:\nR\\in N_R,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n&lt;m\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{clash}}\n=\n\\{(\\geq mR.C)\\sqcap(\\leq nR.C)\\sqsubseteq\\bot:\nR\\in N_R,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n&lt;m\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>布尔和模态规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{base}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{base}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中各分量分别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>限定数目协变规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\geq Q}\n=\n\\{(((C,D)),(\\geq nR.C,\\geq nR.D)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\geq Q}\n=\n\\{(((C,D)),(\\geq nR.C,\\geq nR.D)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>限定数目反变规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\leq Q}\n=\n\\{(((C,D)),(\\leq nR.D,\\leq nR.C)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\leq Q}\n=\n\\{(((C,D)),(\\leq nR.D,\\leq nR.C)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{base}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\geq Q}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\leq Q}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{base}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\geq Q}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\leq Q}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 出发的 ALCQ 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>，且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\geq Q}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\geq Q}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\leq Q}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\leq Q}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导出关系\">8. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 出发的 ALCQ 证明，其末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D)\">\\((C,D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是满足第 7 节九类行条件且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D)\">\\((C,D)\\)</span> 的非空有限序列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与解释\">9. 语义结构与解释</h1>\n<p>定义知识库载体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}=\\{\\mathcal T:\\mathcal T\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}=\\{\\mathcal T:\\mathcal T\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义语义结构集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>。结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\(\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta)\">\\(\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>概念解释函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-)^{\\mathcal I}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\((-)^{\\mathcal I}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top^{\\mathcal I}=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\bot^{\\mathcal I}=\\varnothing,\\quad\n(\\operatorname{name}(A))^{\\mathcal I}=\\iota_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top^{\\mathcal I}=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\bot^{\\mathcal I}=\\varnothing,\\quad\n(\\operatorname{name}(A))^{\\mathcal I}=\\iota_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg C)^{\\mathcal I}=\\Delta\\setminus C^{\\mathcal I},\n\\quad\n(C\\sqcap D)^{\\mathcal I}=C^{\\mathcal I}\\cap D^{\\mathcal I},\n\\quad\n(C\\sqcup D)^{\\mathcal I}=C^{\\mathcal I}\\cup D^{\\mathcal I},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg C)^{\\mathcal I}=\\Delta\\setminus C^{\\mathcal I},\n\\quad\n(C\\sqcap D)^{\\mathcal I}=C^{\\mathcal I}\\cap D^{\\mathcal I},\n\\quad\n(C\\sqcup D)^{\\mathcal I}=C^{\\mathcal I}\\cup D^{\\mathcal I},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall R.C)^{\\mathcal I}\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\forall y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in C^{\\mathcal I})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall R.C)^{\\mathcal I}\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\forall y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in C^{\\mathcal I})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\exists R.C)^{\\mathcal I}\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\exists y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\ \\text{且}\\ y\\in C^{\\mathcal I})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\exists R.C)^{\\mathcal I}\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\exists y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\ \\text{且}\\ y\\in C^{\\mathcal I})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\geq nR.C)^{\\mathcal I}\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:|\\{y\\in C^{\\mathcal I}:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}|\\ge n\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\geq nR.C)^{\\mathcal I}\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:|\\{y\\in C^{\\mathcal I}:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}|\\ge n\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\leq nR.C)^{\\mathcal I}\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:|\\{y\\in C^{\\mathcal I}:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}|\\le n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\leq nR.C)^{\\mathcal I}\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:|\\{y\\in C^{\\mathcal I}:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}|\\le n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-满足关系与语义后承\">10. 满足关系与语义后承</h1>\n<p>定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nC^{\\mathcal I}\\subseteq D^{\\mathcal I}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nC^{\\mathcal I}\\subseteq D^{\\mathcal I}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\in\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\mathcal T\\in\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\mathcal T\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 中每个包含式。</p>\n<p>语义后承定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\">\\(\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\mathcal T\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}C\\sqsubseteq D\">\\(\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-特征差异\">11. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>ALCQ 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\geq nR.C,\\leq nR.C:n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ R\\in N_R,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\geq nR.C,\\leq nR.C:n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ R\\in N_R,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\\},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该对象记录带填充概念 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的限定数目限制如何进入语法、自由名字、替换、公理和规则；它不同于 ALCN 的非限定数目限制。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-整个形式系统\">12. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathbb N,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\\equiv_\\alpha,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n(-)^{\\mathcal I},\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathbb N,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\\equiv_\\alpha,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n(-)^{\\mathcal I},\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCQ}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含限定数目限制、包含式证明和语义后承；不含角色层级、逆角色、名词、数据类型或复杂度元定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"721-ALCQ","text":"721 ALCQ","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-概念表达式","text":"2. 概念表达式","level":1},{"id":"3.-包含式与-TBox","text":"3. 包含式与 TBox","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由名字与替换","text":"4. 自由名字与替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导出关系","text":"8. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与解释","text":"9. 语义结构与解释","level":1},{"id":"10.-满足关系与语义后承","text":"10. 满足关系与语义后承","level":1},{"id":"11.-特征差异","text":"11. 特征差异","level":1},{"id":"12.-整个形式系统","text":"12. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(N_C,